# Positive Chiihou (Blessing of Earth) on non-dealer's first unbroken draw
# (engine.md §4.2 First go-around, rules.md §2.2).
# Dealer Seat 0 discards 1z with no calls; Seat 1 draws 7s on its first unbroken draw -> Chiihou!
# Scoring for Seat 1 (non-dealer, South):
#   Natural yakuman: chiihou:1 -> 1x Yakuman (non-dealer tsumo = 8000 / 16000, +32000).

